  "description": "When she was twenty, she quietly kept Seokjoo in her heart. Now, she was face-to-face with the man who had once left without a word.\n\n\"Director.\"\n\n\"Drop the formalities. Call me like you used to.\"\n\n\"...Sunbae.\"\n\nShe clearly still had no intention of ever calling him oppa. Well, he could wait to hear the word he really wanted—eventually.\n\n\"When I was assigned to your office, was this what you had in mind?\"\n\n\"No.\"\n\n\"Then why, all of a sudden...\"\n\n\"Because you kept going on those damn blind dates.\"\n\nIf he touched her now, he’d lose all control—and he’d make her cry. So he waited. Just a little longer. At his own pace.\n\n\"How far are you planning to go with me?\"\n\nWith Yoon Jiwon... how far?\n\nI'll just take you.\n\nAgain.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12529380)",
